### # Test that "opam switch show" fails on a switch that isn't installed
### opam switch create foo --empty
### opam switch show
foo
### opam switch --switch bar show
[ERROR] The selected switch bar is not installed.
# Return code 2 #
### OPAMSWITCH=bar opam switch show
[ERROR] The selected switch bar is not installed. Please fix the value of the OPAMSWITCH environment variable, or use the '--switch <name>' flag
# Return code 50 #
### opam switch --switch foo show
foo
